  "detail": "The job forwards only PATH, LANG, LIMITLESS_HOME and LIMITLESS_CONFIG_DIR. A daemon started with LIMITLESS_PORT (documented) launches a deploy whose CLI resolves the default or configured port instead (src/cli/client-port.ts) and can drain, health-check or restart the wrong daemon. Pass the running daemon's port to the deploy explicitly (or forward LIMITLESS_PORT and HOME), and add a test asserting the job's command carries it."
 },
